---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy notice for Visit Ålesund: what is and isn't collected." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#10b981" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1419" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
  <title>Privacy — Visit Ålesund</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://alesundtoday.jacosverksted.no/privacy/" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg?v=3" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="64x64" href="/favicon.png?v=3" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=3" sizes="any" />
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png" />
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-900 min-h-screen">
  <main class="max-w-lg mx-auto px-4 py-6 pb-16 space-y-6">

    <p class="text-sm"><a href="/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" data-back>← Visit Ålesund</a></p>

    <!-- English -->
    <article data-lang-block="en" class="space-y-5">
      <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Privacy</h1>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Who is responsible</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Visit Ålesund is a private, non-commercial project run by JacosVerksted, a private individual. It is not affiliated with Ålesund kommune or Ålesund Havn. Questions about privacy: <a class="underline hover:text-gray-800" href="mailto:info@jacosverksted.no">info@jacosverksted.no</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">What the site does not do</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">No cookies, no accounts, no forms, no tracking scripts, no advertising, and nothing is loaded from other websites. The only thing the page stores in your browser is the language you choose; it stays on your device and you can clear it at any time.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Server logs</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">When you open the site, the server infrastructure records standard request information: the time, your IP address, the page or file requested and the response status. Details such as your browser type are not stored.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600"><span class="font-medium text-gray-700">Why:</span> to run and secure the service (for example to spot abuse) and to produce aggregate usage statistics, such as visits over time and where the app is used. <span class="font-medium text-gray-700">Legal basis:</span> legitimate interest in running and improving a small public information service (GDPR Article 6(1)(f)).</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Access to the site is currently restricted by country, which means your IP address is checked against a country database on the server. Nothing is sent to anyone else.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">How long it is kept</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Request logs are kept in rotating log files that are overwritten automatically, so entries typically exist for about two to three weeks at most. Usage reports are aggregate figures, not lists of individual visitors.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Sharing</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Your data is not sold or given to third parties. The links on the page lead to other websites (Ålesund Havn, MET Norway, GitHub) that have their own privacy policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">You can ask for access to, correction or deletion of data about you, and object to its use, by writing to <a class="underline hover:text-gray-800" href="mailto:info@jacosverksted.no">info@jacosverksted.no</a>. Because logs contain only an IP address, I may need you to tell me the address and time. You can also complain to the Norwegian Data Protection Authority, <a class="underline hover:text-gray-800" href="https://www.datatilsynet.no" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Datatilsynet</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Last updated 11 October 2026.</p>
    </article>

    <!-- Norsk (bokmål) -->
    <article data-lang-block="nb" class="space-y-5" hidden>
      <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Personvern</h1>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Hvem som er ansvarlig</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Visit Ålesund er et privat, ikke-kommersielt prosjekt drevet av JacosVerksted, en privatperson. Tjenesten er ikke tilknyttet Ålesund kommune eller Ålesund Havn. Spørsmål om personvern: <a class="underline hover:text-gray-800" href="mailto:info@jacosverksted.no">info@jacosverksted.no</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Hva nettstedet ikke gjør</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Ingen informasjonskapsler, ingen kontoer, ingen skjemaer, ingen sporingsskript, ingen reklame, og ingenting lastes fra andre nettsteder. Det eneste siden lagrer i nettleseren din er språket du velger. Det blir på enheten din, og du kan slette det når som helst.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Serverlogger</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Når du åpner nettstedet, registrerer serverinfrastrukturen vanlig forespørselsinformasjon: tidspunkt, IP-adressen din, siden eller filen som ble forespurt og svarstatus. Opplysninger som nettlesertype lagres ikke.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600"><span class="font-medium text-gray-700">Hvorfor:</span> for å drifte og sikre tjenesten (for eksempel for å oppdage misbruk) og for å lage samlet bruksstatistikk, som besøk over tid og hvor appen brukes. <span class="font-medium text-gray-700">Rettslig grunnlag:</span> berettiget interesse i å drive og forbedre en liten offentlig informasjonstjeneste (GDPR artikkel 6 nr. 1 bokstav f).</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Tilgangen til nettstedet er for øyeblikket begrenset etter land. Det betyr at IP-adressen din sjekkes mot en landsdatabase på serveren. Ingenting sendes til andre.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Hvor lenge opplysningene lagres</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Forespørselslogger lagres i roterende loggfiler som overskrives automatisk, så oppføringer finnes vanligvis i høyst to–tre uker. Bruksrapporter er samlede tall, ikke lister over enkeltbesøkende.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Deling</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Opplysningene dine selges ikke og gis ikke til tredjeparter. Lenkene på siden fører til andre nettsteder (Ålesund Havn, MET Norway, GitHub) som har egne personvernerklæringer.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">Dine rettigheter</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Du kan be om innsyn i, retting eller sletting av opplysninger om deg, og protestere mot bruken, ved å skrive til <a class="underline hover:text-gray-800" href="mailto:info@jacosverksted.no">info@jacosverksted.no</a>. Siden loggene bare inneholder en IP-adresse, kan jeg trenge at du oppgir adressen og tidspunktet. Du kan også klage til <a class="underline hover:text-gray-800" href="https://www.datatilsynet.no" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Datatilsynet</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Sist oppdatert 11. oktober 2026.</p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <script>
    import { getLang } from '../lib/lang';

    // Norwegian (Bokmål and Nynorsk) readers get the Norwegian text; everyone else gets English.
    const lang = getLang() === 'nb' || getLang() === 'nn' ? 'nb' : 'en';
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-lang-block]').forEach((el) => {
      el.hidden = el.dataset.langBlock !== lang;
    });
    document.documentElement.lang = lang === 'nb' ? 'nb' : 'en';
    document.title = lang === 'nb' ? 'Personvern — Visit Ålesund' : 'Privacy — Visit Ålesund';
  </script>
</body>
</html>
